parts:
{
  "prompt": "A clear, scientific-style diagram showing a planetary-scale biological structure. A blue sphere representing Earth sits at the left, and from it extends a long blue cable labeled 'planet line' running diagonally across the page. Wrapped helically around this cable is a green spiral labeled 'life matrix', representing all biological activity on Earth. Within the cable, numerous branching green tendrils weave through and emerge from the blue wrapping, suggesting organismal life growing along the planetary trajectory. The diagram is neat, precise, with clean linework and labeled arrows.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A realistic, three-dimensional science textbook-style illustration showing Earth with visible continents, oceans, and clouds, forming the rounded end of a long, extended tubelike structure. The tube extends backward from Earth into the distance, with blue, green, and white sheathing layers wrapping around it in a helical or coaxial pattern, representing a biological or energetic life-matrix. The tube should have a soft organic gloss, appearing as a semi-transparent structure with embedded flowing patterns. The background is a clean, neutral tone to emphasize the structure.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A highly detailed scientific-style 3D visualization set in space. Background: a deep black starfield filled with high-contrast white stars, evoking the void of space. Foreground: On the leftmost foreground, a realistic Earth rendered in high resolution with true-color blue oceans, green and tan continents, and swirling white clouds. A soft atmospheric glow outlines the Earth. Earth is at the rounded end of a long, tapering tubelike structure that extends into the distance to the right. The surface of this tube is a swirling mix of blue, green, brown, and white, evoking ocean, land, and cloud cover blending like a time-lapse view. Midground: At a midpoint down the tube, a realistic, cratered Moon appears, forming the terminal tip of its own thinner, smoother gray-white tube. This moon-tube corkscrews around the Earth-tube in a broad helix as both extend into the distance. Background right: At the vanishing point, a bright Sun glows yellow-white, radiating solar flares and corona arcs. The Sun is the rounded tip of its own glowing yellow-orange tube. The Earth-Moon helix wraps like a coiled blue-white wire around this solar tube. The overall structure forms two nested orbital corkscrews: the Moon spiraling around Earth, Earth spiraling around the Sun, each represented as tapered, semi-organic cables extending in 3D perspective.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A high-resolution scientific space visualization. In the foreground, Earth is shown as a detailed sphere with true-color blue oceans, green and tan continents, and swirling white clouds, all with a soft atmospheric glow. Earth is embedded at the wide end of a long, swirling, semi-organic tubelike structure that narrows sharply in 3D perspective as it spirals into the distance. The surface of the tube is a dynamic swirl of blue, green, white, and tan, resembling a time-lapse of Earth's surface. Twisting around this Earth-tube in a tight helical spiral is a second tube representing the Moon: grey, cratered, with realistic shading. The Moon is also the wide end of its own narrowing tubelike filament, which wraps around the Earth-tube like a corkscrew, forming a tightly wound double-helix. Far in the background, the Earth-Moon helix wraps around a bright, glowing yellow-white Sun, which is the terminal of its own fiery, orange-white, flaring tube that extends even farther into the dark void. The entire structure is set against a deep black starfield scattered with crisp, high-contrast stars. Strong foreshortening shows the Earth and Moon corkscrews as massive in the foreground, rapidly tapering into the distance toward the Sun.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A semi-realistic, slightly diagrammatic 3D digital illustration of Earth embedded at the rounded end of a large, tube-like structure. The Earth is close in view, showing high-resolution details: true-color blue oceans, green and tan continents, swirling white clouds, and a soft atmospheric glow around its edge. The Earth is smoothly connected to a thick, gently curving tubular extension that arcs out of the frame. The tube has swirled surface coloration mimicking time-lapse visuals of Earth's oceans (blue), land (green/yellow/brown), and clouds (white), blending organically in a semi-fluid, semi-organic sheath. The background is a dark starfield, speckled with sharp white stars. The overall effect is a hybrid between scientific realism and stylized anatomical illustration.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A semi-diagrammatic, three-dimensional digital illustration of Earth embedded at the rounded end of a very thick, cylindrical tube-like structure. The view is close enough that the surface of Earth blends seamlessly with the blunt end of the tube—no extra bulging or globe effect. The tube is extremely wide in the foreground and gradually narrows into the distance, curving gently out of frame with a smooth arc. The tube’s surface features a swirling pattern of blue, green, and white—representing oceans, land, and clouds, as if seen in time-lapse. The background is deep black space with subtle stars. The visual style should be clean, slightly diagrammatic, but realistic in lighting and 3D perspective.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

content.text:
{
  "prompt": "A semi-diagrammatic 3D scientific illustration of Earth as the blunt end of a thick tubular structure extending into the distance in space. The Earth is shown with realistic blue oceans, green and tan continents, and swirling white clouds, but smoothly integrated as the rounded front surface of the tube rather than a separate sphere. The tube extends back into the blackness of space, with a subtle gentle arc and gradually narrows into perspective. The surface of the tube is patterned with swirling blue, green, and white patches, representing ocean, land, and clouds in a time-lapse visual style. Wrapping around the tube are several semi-transparent, vine-like network structures or filaments, lightly embedded into or interacting with the tube's surface, suggestive of a biological or information-rich wrapping. The overall style is slightly stylized but clear and clean, resembling a science textbook illustration.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

parts:
{
  "prompt": "A 3D digital illustration of a large tube in outer space with the Earth forming the blunt, rounded end of the tube. The Earth is highly realistic with true-color features: swirling white clouds, tan-brown continents, and dark blue oceans. The surface of the tube, which extends into the background with a gentle arc, is composed of a motion-blur or time-lapse effect, with Earth's land and water features swirling together. A network of dark green tendrils wraps around the tube, partially visible beneath the semi-transparent cloud layer that smears softly along the surface. The background is a deep starfield, filled with bright white stars on black space.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A high-resolution digital illustration of Earth at the tip of a massive tube-like structure extending into space. The surface of Earth is realistically rendered with dark blue oceans, tan-brown continents, and swirling white clouds. The Earth is the blunt, rounded end of the tube, with no bulging beyond the tube's diameter. The surface of the tube appears like a time-lapse motion blur of Earth's surface, as if the continents and clouds are smeared along its length. A dark green, organic-looking tendril network wraps around the tube, visible beneath the soft cloud streaks, but it does not leave the surface of the tube or Earth. The tube arcs gently into the distance, narrowing in perspective. In the background, space is a deep black with speckled stars, and a glowing, fiery sun-tube can be seen receding into the background, adding a sense of nested orbital scale.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A realistic, high-resolution photograph taken from a low angle using a high vantage point (like a selfie stick) in a public park. The scene features a chaotic and intertwined network of thick, rootlike, fleshy tendrils sprawling across the ground. Each tendril is about twice as tall as a park bench or drinking fountain, and about half the height of a lamp post. The tendrils vary in color, forming a loose weave of pastel, primary, secondary, and tertiary colors. Each individual tendril contains streaks of only one skin tone, including pale pink, olive tan, dark golden brown, or various light and dark browns. The scene is surrounded by grass and elements of a park like benches, walkways, and trees in the background. The tendrils are organic in shape, curved, bumpy, and tangled like frayed ropes or thick roots.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A wide-angle drone photograph showing a public park with large, thick, unbranched, rootlike tendrils scattered across a grassy field. Each tendril is larger than a park bench, with no visible terminal ends or only occasional blunt ones. The tendrils form curving, intersecting paths, like gigantic spaghetti noodles—some looping randomly in the field, others disappearing in pairs into the surrounding trees. The tendrils are streaked with a chaotic and random distribution of colors, skewing towards blacks, denim blues, khakis, and whites. Each tendril has a long continuous streak of human skin tone running its length, and most also have a continuous ridge-colored stripe in either black, brown, straw yellow, or white. The tendrils do not overlap vertically, but lie flat on the ground, appearing woven into the terrain. The photo has a high level of realism and is framed like an aerial drone shot.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "An overhead drone-view photograph of a Metro Park at low angle, with a wide-angle lens. The scene shows a footpath with lamp posts and a couple of benches, surrounded by a grassy field and a nearby lake. A single large, thick, pipe- or rope-like biological structure runs along the footpath and disappears into the woods in the distance. The structure is not circular in cross-section, but instead has a rounded ridge running along its top, flanked by ledges that fall off into rounded corners. These corners drop into steep, undulating slopes terminating in lateral seams. Each seam undulates independently, with fleshy frills emerging along the seams. Beneath each seam, the tube has nearly vertical, narrower sides that descend to the ground. The coloration along the structure is mostly linear and streaked along its length, with black being the dominant hue. The structure may intersect with itself or features of the park but passes through them instead of lying over or under. The scene is realistic and resembles high-resolution drone photography.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A highly detailed, diagrammatic 3D visualization in a public park setting. The scene is captured from a slightly tilted overhead drone or selfie-stick angle. Two large ribbon-like structures follow the curve of a footpath, mimicking the silhouette profile of a human standing upright. Each ribbon is an extrusion of a human form, stretched horizontally through space: the head forms a tall dorsal ridge, the shoulders extrude into lateral ledges, the arms become vertically hanging ridges that obscure the torso, with frilled features mid-way down corresponding to the hands, and legs taper downward with rhythmic undulations mimicking walking. The surface of each extrusion is motion-blurred, with slight twists and warps from arm movements. One extrusion is pale pink with denim-blue sides and a navy stripe along the top (like a hat). The other is pale yellow on top, with streaked black-and-white sides, and intermittent beige-white frills running along its middle (representing hand motion). Both structures undulate along the ground without overlapping, passing through one another at crossings. The park includes lamp posts, benches, trees, and a curved path. Lighting is soft, like late afternoon, and there is no visible globe or tube, only the park and the extrusion tubes.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A surreal, realistic park scene viewed from a low overhead angle, as if from a selfie stick or small drone. Two large, ribbon-like tubes wind along the edge of a footpath in a metro park with benches, lampposts, grass, and trees. These tubes do NOT terminate in human heads or torsos. Instead, each one is shaped as an extruded human-profile cross-section—the outline of a standing person, including a head, arms, and legs—stretched horizontally to form the entire length of each tube. They resemble time-lapse streaks of a walking person, thick and opaque. One tube has a pale pink flesh-toned head-ridge with denim blue flanks and a navy dorsal stripe along its top. The other tube is slightly smaller, with a pale yellow top ridge, black and white streaked flanks, and intermittent beige-white frills along its sides (resembling extruded waving hands). Both tubes appear to be walking forms frozen in motion-blurred extrusion, undulating slightly due to human movement. The background is a naturalistic park with trees, a path, and soft lighting.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A wide-angle, low overhead drone photograph of a public park path with lush green grass, benches, and lamp posts. Along the path are two enormous elongated structures, each shaped like a continuous time-lapse silhouette profile of a walking human, extruded into opaque 3D tubes. These 'humaniform extrusion tubes' have a vertically exaggerated cross-section shaped like a standing person. Each tube includes a large rounded ridge for the head, lateral bulges for the shoulders, arm extensions that obscure the torso, and undulating vertical leg-like sides where the motion of walking feet would be. The surface of each tube is motion-blurred along its length. The left tube has a pale flesh-toned ridge with denim blue flanks and a navy dorsal stripe (suggesting a hat). The right tube has a pale yellow ridge, with black and white streaked sides and intermittent beige-white frills where the hands are extruded in motion. The tubes curve with the path and intersect, but do not overlap. The image should look photographic and naturalistic, with detailed texture and realistic lighting.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A simplified anatomical cross-section diagram of a humanoid figure, viewed from the front. The figure is stylized and abstracted, with concentric layers representing different tissue types. At the center is a blue circle representing the brain. Surrounding the brain is a dark gray structure representing the skull and internal bone features, including simplified rib-like ovals. This is encased in a red/pink layer representing muscle, and the entire figure is outlined in a tan/brown outer layer representing skin. The whole figure has a head-shaped top, a tapering torso, and a blocky lower half, resembling a simplified human silhouette. The design is diagrammatic and clean, suitable for scientific visualization.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A 3D scientific-style illustration showing multiple extruded humanoid-shaped cross-sections branching from a single thick tubular structure. Each cross-section is shaped like a simplified human figure in profile—rounded head, shoulders, torso, arms, and legs—extruded along the length of the tube like a ribbon. The cross-sections are color-coded: blue inner core (representing neural material), surrounded by gray (bone), red (muscle), and gold outer sheath (skin). The tubes branch in organic, smooth curves, with no kinks or sharp angles. The background is a clean, white scientific backdrop, focusing attention on the structure. The image should resemble a stylized anatomical or biological model with crisp detail and subtle shading to enhance the three-dimensionality.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}

{
  "prompt": "A simplified anatomical diagram showing a stylized cross-section of a humanoid figure in a schematic form. The cross-section is vertically elongated and shaped like a stylized human form with a large rounded head and blocky shoulders and torso. The image shows a layered structure with clearly distinct colors for each layer: a blue circular brain at the top, enclosed in a white layer representing bone, followed by a red layer representing muscle, and a yellow outer layer representing skin. The design is minimalistic, with clean outlines and flat colors, set against a grid-paper style background.",
  "size": "1024x1024"
}
